Is there a list of all the ways that you can lose your protection?  (I
couldn't find it in the FAQ and was getting nowhere with Google
groups.)

I know that you can lose it by:
 * Praying at a non-aligned altar (make your unholy water BEFORE you
   donate to the priests.)
 * Attacking a co-aligned priest (even by killing a gas spore where it
   hits the priest, or by breaking a wand of create-monster where the 
   priest gets hit with the blast.) (I'm not sure on the outcomes for
   attacking cross-aligned priests, though.  You don't lose it for 
   attacking Molloch's priests.)

Also, is there a strategy for stealing the money from a priest and
re-donating it, without losing your protection?  (EG, can you poly
into a leprachaun, steal, cast charm-monster, dontate, repeat? or 
do you lose your protection when you steal and p.o. the priest?)

